  "details": "When toggling a video player's audio source on and off, either by the gameobject or the component, the audio correctly toggles on and off. However, spatialization breaks when the source gets re-enabled. When it comes back on, it maintains the spatialization of the frame it was re-enabled on, meaning if the audio source was to your right when it was turned back on, the source will sound like it is to your right no matter where you look.",
